== Quotes ==

=== External ===
{{Quote|Adventure deeper into A MINECRAFT MOVIE! Compete in elytra races, survive the night, and sneak into a woodland mansion in this free DLC.|Marketplace description}}

{{Quote|Enter the arcade and compete in elytra races, survive the night, and sneak into a woodland mansion! Play iconic moments from the film in A MINECRAFT MOVIE DLC and see if you can reach the top of the leaderboard, whether you bring along friends or play with the heroes from the movie.|[[Cristina Anderca]]<ref>{{Mcnet|a-minecraft-movie-out-now|A MINECRAFT MOVIE: OUT NOW|April 4, 2025|Cristina Anderca}}</ref>}}

=== Internal ===

==== Intro ====
{{q|Welcome to Game Over World! I know. Awesome.|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|Hope you're up for a challenge, the Garbage Man has new games in store.|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|Check out my arcade machines and test 'em.|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|Just like in life, high scores means prizes|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|And if you're REALLY good, maybe you'll get an invite to our launch party!|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}

==== Garrett ====
{{q|Checked out each game yet? My favourite is the {{AMCM|cube}} one.|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|The games I've made are totally not inspired by [[A Minecraft Movie|real events]]. Totally.|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|Got all the rewards yet? You need a high score so you might wanna get some reps in.|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|No participation award here, only HIGH SCORE AWARDS!|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|Time for a protein break?|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|You can play as my buddy {{AMCM|Steve}} in these games!|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|Sorry, no autographs.|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|Not all of can be pros.|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|If you get a high score maybe we can be friends.|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|Hot Garbage Tip: Grab a flyer for my mentorship program before you leave.|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|Hot Garbage Tip: Only with a high score can you truly take out the trash.|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|Hot Garbage Tip: Remember, there are two "I"s in WINNING.|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}
{{q|Hot Garbage Tip: Start winning those high scores if you want to win at life.|image=GarrettMovieFace.png}}

